+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- `Registry::check_transforms(&batch)`: read-only dry run returning the
+  first error `add_transform` would report inserting the batch in order.
+  Under one `&mut`/write guard, check-then-add cannot fail midway; across
+  two guards it can (documented).
+
